{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":1,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1466017474,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxNjA0OTkwMDI=","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/553","origin":"github"},"title":"datalad install should group files for a single 'annex get' invocation","message":"ATM, it takes a while to run e.g. 'datalad install *.dcm' whenever those files come e.g. from an archive which is already extracted etc... primarily it is because install calls 'annex get' on each file separately, which in turn starts a separate git-annex-remote-datalad-archives... that consumes time for no good reason.  The same applies to uninstall.\n\nSee e.g. below 10x difference while 'installing' or 'dropping' 10 files.\n\n``` shell\n$\u003e DATALAD_LOGLEVEL=WARN /usr/bin/time datalad install 032*.dcm\n10 installed items are available at\n/tmp/collection_2014_subdicoms/DICOMS/OvalsTI001_raw_DICOM/run1/0320.dcm\n...\n4.71user 1.02system 0:06.49elapsed 88%CPU (0avgtext+0avgdata 41232maxresident)k\n\nhopa:/tmp/collection_2014_subdicoms/DICOMS/OvalsTI001_raw_DICOM/run1\n$\u003e DATALAD_LOGLEVEL=WARN /usr/bin/time datalad uninstall 032*.dcm\n4.76user 1.17system 0:06.76elapsed 87%CPU (0avgtext+0avgdata 41156maxresident)k\n\nhopa:/tmp/collection_2014_subdicoms/DICOMS/OvalsTI001_raw_DICOM/run1\n$\u003e DATALAD_LOGLEVEL=WARN /usr/bin/time git annex get 032*.dcm    \nget 0320.dcm (from datalad-archives...) \n...\n(recording state in git...)\n0.44user 0.07system 0:00.57elapsed 89%CPU (0avgtext+0avgdata 41492maxresident)k\n16inputs+0outputs (0major+28794minor)pagefaults 0swaps\n```\n\nnot to say that one file at a time creates a commit to git-annex for each one of those gets I think... we should try to minimize amount of commits one way or another","files":null}]}